viewer-d4835\">HALF A CUP COCONUT MILK<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" id=\"viewer-41t7m\">I tbs COCONUT YOGURT<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" id=\"viewer-1dd44\">I tsp MATCHA POWDER<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" id=\"viewer-3lo7h\">ICE CUBES ( optional )<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" id=\"viewer-9hpcj\">Blend up and drink immediately and Enjoy !!<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Avocado is packed full of vitamins, minerals, fibre, folate and potassium- ( more than bananas ).It is proven to lower <a class=\"read-more\" href=\"https:\/\/refreshwellbeing.com.au\/can-the-humble-avocado-be-the-key-to-weight-loss\/\">Read More &rarr;<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":144,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[5],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-141","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-yoga"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v26.7 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Can the humble Avocado be the key to weight loss? - Balanced | BMS Wellbeing Studio<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/refreshwellbeing.com.au\/can-the-humble-avocado-be-the-key-to-weight-loss\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Can the humble Avocado be the key to weight loss? - Balanced | BMS Wellbeing Studio\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Avocado is packed full of vitamins, minerals, fibre, folate and potassium- ( more than bananas ).It is proven to lower Read More &rarr;\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/refreshwellbeing.com